        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knobset with Round Georgetown Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Rose is a great addition to any traditional home. The crystal knob with the round rose really brings out the unique characteristics of your home. This knobset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. Easy to install, it will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOBIA Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Georgetown Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Biarritz Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Georgetown Series Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Depth:  2.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GEOBIA-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262319\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GEOBIA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Rose",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOBIA, Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Rose - The Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Rose is a great addition to any traditional home. The crystal knob with the round rose really brings out the unique characteristics of your home. This knobset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. Easy to install, it will fit doors 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Crystal Biarritz Knobset with Georgetown Roses, Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Roses, Grandeur GEOBIA, GRA-GEOBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knobset with Round Georgetown Rosettes, Biarritz Knob With Georgetown Rosettes, Georgetown Series Biarritz Knobs, glass knobs, crystal knobs, classic knobs, ornate knobs, victorian knobs,"
